<div class="main"><div class="page-header"><div><h2 class="page-heading">Confirm Handover</h2><p class="page-subtitle">Please verify the delivery with the recipient's secure OTP code.</p></div><div class="profile-section"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/50" class="profile-img" alt="profile"></div></div><div class="otp-grid"><div class="content-box"><div class="task-tag-row"><span class="badge badge-active">DEMO OTP: 123456</span></div><div class="info-item"><p class="info-label">DEMONSTRATION</p><p class="info-value">Enter code 123456 to verify.</p></div></div><div class="content-box otp-card"><h3>Security Verification</h3><p class="otp-instruction">Enter the 6-digit handover code provided by the recipient.</p><div class="otp-inputs"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"><input type="text" maxlength="1" class="otp-box" inputmode="numeric"></div><button type="button" id="verify-otp" class="btn btn-primary btn-full">Verify Handover</button><p id="otp-message" role="status"></p><a href="update-delivery-status.php" class="btn btn-outline btn-full">Back to Delivery Status</a><p class="help-text">This is a demonstration only. No code is sent.</p></div></div></div></div>
<script>var boxes=document.getElementsByClassName('otp-box');for(var i=0;i<boxes.length;i++){boxes[i].addEventListener('input',function(){this.value=this.value.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'').slice(0,1);if(this.value&&this.nextElementSibling){this.nextElementSibling.focus();}});}document.getElementById('verify-otp').addEventListener('click',function(){var code='';for(var i=0;i<boxes.length;i++){code+=boxes[i].value;}var message=document.getElementById('otp-message');if(code==='123456'){message.textContent='Handover verified successfully.';message.style.color='green';}else{message.textContent='Incorrect code. Please enter 123456.';message.style.color='red';}});</script></body></html>
